                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h2]It's missing the Pocus but packs a lot of Hocus![/h2]\r\n\r\nNoooo it's not those shrooms you just took. Hocus is a 2D puzzle game with some 3D optical illusion of sorts. Figuring out the illusion is part of the puzzle and actually fun. My brain is now dead.\r\n\r\nNo really it's a great mind bending game that gets you thinking, \"Why did I play this just for the achievements?\" Or did I?\r\n\r\nAchievements are pretty simple to complete as long as your brain works.\r\n\r\n[h2]7/10[/h2]\r\n\r\n[h3][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45905648-Gork%2527s-Game-Grind/]Check out my curated list of games[/url][/h3]",
